      "side": 1,
      "message": "This was implementated according to the following design:\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/docs/+/92069\n\nPS14 creates no D-Bus object for the state sensor itself.\n* The blocker is that we have no suitable PDI to associated it with the corresponding PLDM entity.\n\nIn this case, we have no place to publishes the `op_state`. \n* Perhaps adding logs is a possible option. I didn\u0027t do it at first because I found the logs is too much and can only be reduced by merging patches for each state set.\n\nIf you think this is bothering, I can add the logs for your concerns so that we can know what is happening for the state sensor, at least from the logs.",
